{
	"title": "Danger Close",
	"description": "The view through an AC-130 gunship's sensor: a slow left-hand orbit over a generated countryside of hills, lakes, towns, roads and forests, with TV, white-hot and black-hot thermal and night-vision modes and a HUD of your own callsign. In silence the allies patrol out of their outposts; when music plays the enemy comes in columns and builds a base, and the gunship fires on the beat — 25 mm, 30 mm and the 105 mm by default, Bofors, Hellfires, rockets, glide bombs, a laser and a railgun if you enable them. Day and night follow your PC clock, the land follows the seasons; rain, snow, fog, clouds under the aircraft, anti-aircraft fire and flares.",
